/*
 * Extended glyph set. Same rules as core.ts: 16x16 grids, `.` transparent,
 * `#` and `o` both currentColor (monochrome). This file is the growing catalogue;
 * core.ts is frozen.
 *
 * Outlines are drawn the way core.ts draws them: 2px for strokes that carry
 * the shape (arrow shafts, bars, diagonals) and 1px for the walls of large
 * boxed forms, which read as outlines rather than vanishing. Accent is spent
 * only on the part of a glyph that is doing something — a lit window, a
 * keyhole, the core of a bolt.
 */

